  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Shows how far a dynamic brain PET acquisition can be shortened, subsampled, made noisier or moved before regional time-activity measures, connectivity matrices and radiomic features stop being reliable, and whether simple temporal recovery restores them. Data used in the run: synthetic. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
